  description="Desarrollo, estrés estadístico y ejecución algorítmica. La diferencia absoluta entre adivinar y operar con ventaja matemática."
>
  <Nav />

  <!--
    ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
    SCROLL-JACKING ZONE — 4 tall sections with sticky viewports.
    Background: transparent → fixed WebGL canvas shows through.
    Each section has data-section for SceneManager + sub-slides
    that cross-fade based on scroll progress.
    Total scroll height ≈ 1200vh.
    ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  -->

